    "font" : null,
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "content" : "Last January; submitted a digital projected competition print from my digital Canon D60 SLR which showed some wind generators against a plain blue sky. Two of our discerning members, Jean Timmermeister and Valerie Henschel commented that the sky had a dim but noticeable dust spot on it. had not noticed it There have been a lot of changes in my life in the last two years, and I have decided to move from western Washington where I have lived all my life to Carlsbad, California. Ihave some family in the area and had met a friend there last year. She is a world traveler and an avid photographer. But the Northwest will always be my \"home\""
  }, {
